{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_03_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "71339018fa059c1e0dbe32d21284cc9f4e3ba92fd6c2656f4de8a0451bac0bd9", "ja": "北国から来たアイドル、ひなたんの朝は早い。\n地方公演の準備に加え、野菜の世話もあるからだ……。", "zh": "来自北国的偶像──日日很早就起床了。\n因为她除了要准备地方公演，还要照顾蔬菜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_03_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "76d78f7ed041cbac5de92c296ad619f3e991f5249057fc459b6120705dfc8228", "ja": "手を抜いたら、おいしく育たないからねぇ。\nアイドルもガーデニングも、一緒だべさ。", "zh": "要是偷懒的话，蔬菜就不会长得好吃了嘛。\n偶像跟园艺都是一样哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_03_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "c4ef660c82d43d063406dee509e5e0f6ed3ea1d513b751094096966a42ccfb77", "ja": "気になるのは、最近植えたキュウリのことだという。\nがんばれ、ひなたん……最高の収穫を目指してっ！", "zh": "她表示很在意最近种下的小黄瓜。\n加油，日日……以最棒的收成为目标迈进吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_03_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "73219be2256b54f068806190b16710751b77cd183f4cca0417982d6a12fc2d3d", "ja": "なんでやねん！\n目指してるんは、もちろん……最高の公演やんな♪", "zh": "搞什么呀！\n我们的目标当然是……最棒的公演才对啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_03_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "889ce21218bbee3f22c4c46fa50024034bc9af83320ae13a7a27785f422cd6d3", "ja": "公演もキュウリも、みんなによろこんでもらえるように\nがんばるべさ。みんな、見に来てねぇ！", "zh": "不论公演还是小黄瓜，我都会努力让大家开心的哪。\n大家要来看喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_03_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "2571f269162daa095126bbd18c14bca98f3acb2425d517f393e32ed291cfaa61", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさんです。\nあたし、あんな感じでよかったんだろか？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n我刚刚的表现还可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_03_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a3cdb6424288e9ac761ea82604096752fb4aabd7fc4730d238118206e464f779", "ja": "お疲れさま、ひなた。\nひなたらしさが出ていて、よかったと思うよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，日向。\n有展现日向的风格，我觉得很棒呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_03_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "2804d445fddac7c157e5d7fa2e9642c8d0e895a29e7deae33eb4aa8a8ada6120", "ja": "はいっ、最高でした！　ひなたちゃんの癒やしの\nオーラが、モニター越しに溢れていました……！", "zh": "对啊，真是太棒了！日向的疗愈气息\n透过萤幕满满地散发出来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_03_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "3df1323aadbd1f1987d5c37450ef0bf50dbd194b894f9158eb5989d482f9ce0f", "ja": "そ、そうかねえ？　えへへ……。", "zh": "是、是吗？嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_03_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "45058366107fb9047140eb633307d369586965bf30040b557532eee115ccde5a", "ja": "でもあたし、アドリブなんてできそうもなかったから、\n奈緒さんの台本があって、助かったべさ。", "zh": "因为我的临场反应很差，\n有奈绪的脚本真是得救了哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_03_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "18569a289b05652f88c6e075eb06b0b31a82118baf5307276a4e9dd895a979f4", "ja": "役に立てたみたいでよかったわ♪\nひなた宛てのコメント、いっぱい来とったで！", "zh": "看来有帮到你，太好了♪\n来了好多给日向的留言呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_03_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "1a7fa9756c5cec68cd8ffa3807dae21335e3fe69016c0977aeb36bc1988b9e34", "ja": "見て見て、みんな！\n再生数も番組登録者数も、どんどん伸びてるよ～！", "zh": "大家快看！\n观看次数跟节目订阅人数一直在上升～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_03_1021_025roc", "source_sha256": "e76220369b7448f127f59a1a8a137871e584d2c38e9235e56a4b098c04d58b86", "ja": "ヒナタのゲスト回、大成功ですね！\n『AKANE★CHANNEL』は止まりませんよ♪", "zh": "日向当Guest的这一集圆满成功呢！\n《AKANE★CHANNEL》还会继续往前冲喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_03_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "6525ead3a5c6c8bd344cbd7c98ea9d6c200e66088c2530ba01995b30a16db29d", "ja": "ううっ、我ながら怖い！\n茜ちゃん、自分たちの溢れんばかりの才能が怖いよ！", "zh": "呜呜！我们真是太可怕了！\n小茜觉得小茜我们卓越不凡的才能太惊人了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_03_1023_p", "source_sha256": "b19889318f27f1ee800906645b63293fd27af695d001d929456ba5c742b2f842", "ja": "確かに、ビックリするほどの反響だな……。\n動画を見て劇場に来たって人も、増えてるみたいだし。", "zh": "大家的回响的确很令人吃惊呢……\n而且好像也有不少人是看了影片才来剧场的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_03_1024_037nao", "source_sha256": "497748df51c2a664e1884ea857cdd437a2c1530a2f030484cf0465d6e6075749", "ja": "なーなー、{$P$}さん。\n私、作家の才能あるんとちゃいます？　えへへ♪", "zh": "欸～欸～{$P$}先生。\n我是不是有当作家的天分？嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_03_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "4f8d174f5ad1f9d56a6ee7195c51e5ee86e5a8edccc2bcbdb1ce4e2877f98458", "ja": "ありさも、こんな形でお役に立てるなんて。カメラ越し\nにアイドルちゃんを見つめ続けてきて、よかったです！", "zh": "亚利沙也没想到会以这种形式帮上忙。\n幸好亚利沙一直以来都是透过镜头看着偶像宝贝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_03_1026_p", "source_sha256": "59f9db4d186fcebf7c5327e971d25b28de0c0a4247e03398a9a0f4f3c234bdb9", "ja": "うん。ふたりのおかげでもあるけど、\n本業はアイドルだから、忘れないでくれよ！", "zh": "嗯，虽然这也算是你们两人的功劳，\n不过也别忘记你们的正职是偶像喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_03_1027_037nao", "source_sha256": "5af50b53e32ffc66730f36ee1fbfb253cd5888f8f611b64c6ad72a902c6ae3c1", "ja": "えへへ、そうでした♪\nでも今日は、ごほうびにデラックスランチ食べたろ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，对吼♪\n但今天是不是该吃个豪华午餐当作奖励啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_03_1028_028ari", "source_sha256": "f506cf564344753b15393730ac1e0fec9a2bd97731e6b9b605aef4277fdd001e", "ja": "だったらありさも、スペシャルパフェを\n食べちゃいます！　ひなたちゃんはどうしますか？", "zh": "这样的话，亚利沙也要吃特制圣代！\n日向要吃什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_03_1029_035hin", "source_sha256": "84e5e55d1cb99b04f8bb3be7e327ff149a2894314fe24fe3d2cee48c65ce8010", "ja": "えっ？　えっと……。\nあたしは、普通のごはんでいいよぉ。", "zh": "咦？这个……\n我吃一般的饭就好了啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_03_1030_p", "source_sha256": "830703906bd57b0c4468f52e7c9b7cddf856b8f8518097fed2035bc719c37227", "ja": "もしかして、それも経費に……？\n会議費にしても、ちょっと厳しいような……。", "zh": "这该不会也算在公帐……？\n要报会议费好像也有点牵强……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_03_1031_037nao", "source_sha256": "a72772a7ff587d088a359d6d515b5603da3aa914c221c917a0ebcb7d5740ec3c", "ja": "大丈夫！　次の公演、絶対成功しますって♪\nロコと茜は、なんにする？", "zh": "可以啦！反正下次公演一定会成功的咩♪\nROCO跟茜要吃什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
